  "details": "# Issue:\n\nCurrently the button to export your camera paths is called `Export Path`, this can be a bit confusing as it makes it sound like you are exporting the current path and not all of your paths.\n\nI personally ran into questioning how to export the selected path my self just to look at the JSON later on to find out it exports ALL of your paths.\n\n# Suggestion / Expected Name:\n\nRename `Export Path` to `Export Paths` to make it clearer what it actually does.\n\n# Attachments:\n\nHere is a screenshot of the button:",
